From a4a2081b2f0e1cf1bfac183b5ab8977e1efb455a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Orpere <23037260+Orpere@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:31:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ollama): add Ollama Cloud provider (plan + monthly
 usage)

Adds an "Ollama Cloud" provider to AI Quotas:
- plan name via POST https://ollama.com/api/me (API key, with opencode
  auth.json fallback)
- monthly included usage ($used of $limit) and reset time by parsing
  https://ollama.com/settings with a __Secure-session cookie (Ollama
  exposes no usage API; see ollama/ollama#12532)
- popout tab/card with plan badge, usage bar, reset label and pin
  button; bar-pill entry; plan_only/unavailable/error states
- settings: provider toggle + optional API key and session cookie fields
- tests: test-ollama.sh (15 cases), test-ollama-edge.sh (8 cases),
  sanitized settings-page fixture; existing harnesses set
  AIQ_OLLAMA_ENABLED=0 for isolation
- hardening: CRLF/whitespace scrubbing for credentials, ISO-8601 reset
  normalization, whitespace-tolerant meter parsing

Based on upstream agneswd/dms-ai-quotas @ 222184e.
